  "title": "Cabinet approves ₹1.86 lakh crore Green Energy Corridor to evacuate 135GW renewable energy",
  "summary": "The Indian government has cleared a ₹1.86 lakh crore Green Energy Corridor initiative to evacuate 135GW of renewable energy across states, with battery storage systems expected to support the project by 2032-33.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Indian government cleared a ₹1.86 lakh crore Green Energy Corridor scheme to evacuate 135GW of renewable energy across states.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The initiative includes deployment of 50 GWh of battery energy storage systems by 2032-33.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The initiative is part of broader efforts to enhance India’s energy infrastructure.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
